ll", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Starting Out"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "My Favorite Things"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Time"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use these words to talk about parts of the day:<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">morning</span> - from around 5:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m.*<br/><span class = \"strong\">afternoon</span> - from 12:00 noon to around 6:00 p.m.<br/><span class = \"strong\">evening</span> - from around 6:00 p.m. to 12:00 midnight.<br/><span class = \"strong\">night</span> - from around 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 a.m.<br/><br/>*12:00 p.m. is <span class = \"italic\">noon</span>, when you eat lunch<br/>12:00 a.m. is <span class = \"italic\">midnight</span>, at night<br/><br/>You use these words to talk about parts of the week:<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">weekday</span> - Monday - Friday<br/><span class = \"strong\">weekend</span> - Saturday + Sunday<br/><br/>These words can be placed in the plural form to  show you do something on a regular basis.<br><br>We use prepositions when we talk about the times in the day and week.<br> We use <span class=\"strong\">IN</span> for long parts of the day: in the morning, in the afternoon, in the evening. <br>We use <span class=\"strong\">ON</span> for parts of the week: on weekdays (Monday to Friday), on the weekend."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The library is closed in the evenings."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The restaurant is open in the afternoons and in the evenings on weekends."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I go to work on Saturdays."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About LIkes and Dislikes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Simple tense to talk about things you like or don't like. <br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Positive expressions</span>:<br/>I love \u263a\u263a\u263a <br/>I'm a fan of \u263a\u263a<br/>I like \u263a<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Negative expressions</span>:<br/>I don't like \u2639<br/>I hate \u2639\u2639<br/>I can't stand \u2639\u2639\u2639"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I love Japanese food!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't like Mexican food very much."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I can't stand small olives."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "open"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ready for business"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is the restaurant open on Saturdays?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you plan to meet a person."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hungry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wanting food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm hungry! When is lunch?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "perfect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: 7 o' clock is perfect."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fantastic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very good"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's fantastic!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "weekend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Saturday and Sunday"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant is closed on the weekend."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to meet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to see someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's meet at 7 p.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I can't stand ..."}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I hate..."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't stand jello."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm a fan of ..."}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I like something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm a fan of Japanese food."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "big"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large in size"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love big tuna rolls."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "small"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "limited in size"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Examples: I don't like small olives."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob10aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 - 4 things you do on a regular day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the time of day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your list with a partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 2 sentences. Start your sentences with the time of day, such as: <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIn the mornings, we ...\u201d</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences out loud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I express my daily routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I do every day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask about another person's daily routines."}]}], "type": "sena"}